      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Tamboril. Chinchou vive nas profundezas do oceano, onde a luz solar não alcança. Ele pisca as luzes de suas antenas para se comunicar com outros de sua espécie. Pelas pontas delas, dispara eletricidade com cargas positiva e negativa para atordoar os adversários.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Chinchou pode evoluir para Lanturn no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bubble, Supersonic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bubble Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Signal Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Aqua Ring</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Charge, Hydro Pump, Ion Deluge</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Amnesia, Attract, Blizzard, Bounce, Brine, Charge, Charge Beam, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Dazzling Gleam, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endure, Facade, Flip Turn, Frustration, Hail, Heal Bell, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Liquidation, Muddy Water, Protect, Psybeam, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rising Voltage, Round, Scald, Screech, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Volt Switch, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Amnesia, Brine, Flail, Mist, Psybeam, Screech, Shock Wave, Soak, Sucker Punch, Water Pulse, Whirlpool</p>",
